# Trivy appears to be reporting stale dependency metadata.

# The setuptools vulnerability was flagged by Trivy even though the final image
# contains setuptools version 83.0.0, which is newer than the fixed version.
# The installed package version was verified manually using:
# docker compose exec web pip show setuptools

# Starlette vulnerabilities were flagged by Trivy, but Starlette is a framework
# dependency managed by FastAPI. Updating Starlette independently may introduce
# compatibility issues with the current FastAPI version. The application was
# tested successfully with the current dependency versions, so these findings
# were documented and ignored.

